
### 2. `.gitignore` — Very useful to demonstrate

This teaches students that **not everything inside a project folder should be pushed to GitHub**.

```gitignore id="n5r2px"
# Operating system files
.DS_Store
Thumbs.db

# Editor files
.vscode/
.idea/

# Logs
*.log

# Temporary files
*.tmp

# Environment variables
.env
.env.local

# Node dependencies
node_modules/